👑🧠 Birbal and the Test of Honesty (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar wanted to test the honesty of his people.

He asked Birbal for an idea.

Birbal placed a large pot at the palace gate.

He announced, “Everyone must pour a glass of milk into this pot tonight.”

That night, people came one by one.

But many thought, “If I pour water instead of milk, no one will notice.”

So they poured water.

The next morning, Akbar and Birbal looked into the pot.

It was full of water, not milk.

Akbar was disappointed.

Birbal said, “When everyone thinks someone else will do the right thing, no one does.”

Akbar understood the lesson.

💖 Moral:

Do the right thing, even when no one is watching.
